{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/27d546c82a05cdd2b4fbdcc055a4d319.poster.avif?t=1772815366\" width=560 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/27d546c82a05cdd2b4fbdcc055a4d319.webm?t=1772815366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/27d546c82a05cdd2b4fbdcc055a4d319.mp4?t=1772815366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2728 What Awaits You:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradeable ships, unlockable weapons, and skill trees that let you craft your own path to becoming an ace pilot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive bosses, dynamic environments, and intense battles across space, air, and sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dazzling arsenal: unleash power beams, multi-missile barrages, and even a nuke strike. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/9d66df33847b6bbb168e4adc5675b227.poster.avif?t=1772815366\" width=560 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/9d66df33847b6bbb168e4adc5675b227.webm?t=1772815366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/9d66df33847b6bbb168e4adc5675b227.mp4?t=1772815366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83d\ude80 Meet the FUR Squadron:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train with a renegade crew of elite pilots using cutting-edge VR tech. Complete their missions, boost your Overdrive, and unlock story-rich conversations that reveal their pasts\u2014and yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/8d8f865e9456062478dffd807efa55e9.poster.avif?t=1772815366\" width=560 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/8d8f865e9456062478dffd807efa55e9.webm?t=1772815366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/8d8f865e9456062478dffd807efa55e9.mp4?t=1772815366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udf0c A Universe in Peril:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;War drums are beating at the Bist System. Alarmed by the increasing activity of the dangerous Marauders, the Chimera Federation has decided to reinforce the troops of its space fleet. A brave and determined recruit is sent to the renegade FUR Squadron for special training using their virtual reality technology. Will they manage to hone their skills before it's too late?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"It's quiet... Too quiet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2674650/e229d6bc3fa7978c8af3dc18a6d01933cd0f493d.jpg"},{"name":"Something's coming from the sea!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2674650/ba3c9ed129a451c6b2c16d8d93537d57daf7899a.jpg"},{"name":"Where is the big boy?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2674650/d9ee5de089d32e861c7abba77b05e376b9ac2668.jpg"},{"name":"Engage!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2674650/e64d00410aeeeedc12e29911454c129d9287cf82.jpg"},{"name":"I admit defeat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2674650/f206e27521c58c20357833d63f276459e023e5ba.jpg"},{"name":"Afraid of depths","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2674650/009925a2fa4f61c5e744a92665c2d9fa569c8d8c.jpg"},{"name":"Trust your instincts!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2674650/b0663d4b2bebd8b4e8054fc6d8c6c453fd695c4d.jpg"},{"name":"Do a barrel roll!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2674650/58e8cf8d8b72990d98a8704457bb12907d411fac.jpg"},{"name":"Hey... wanna dance?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2674650/3f5774ffc60e7fca35e7f8fce0958e550af264ea.jpg"},{"name":"Back to the FUR 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2674650/551a1a8d13a105012cd99bc1e0defd4ff06d7d2c.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2674650?t=1772815366","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772815366","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/2171d92d0523b942a672a5a7747174a2f8ab6072/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772815366","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/2171d92d0523b942a672a5a7747174a2f8ab6072/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772815366","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3186310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_par